OL,3,GNEWSAFootball to the face revealed my
OL,4,Adaughter's cancer
OL,5,
OL,6,FWhen Aaron's five-year-old daughter,
OL,7,FHarper, developed a lump on her neck
OL,8,Fhours after being hit in the face by a
OL,9,Ffootball at school, he expected doctors
OL,10,Fto say she had a cyst.
OL,12,F"Never in a million years" did he think
OL,13,Ftheir visit to an urgent treatment
OL,14,Fcentre would lead to her being
OL,15,Fdiagnosed with cancer.
OL,17,FHarper, now seven and from Pinxton in
OL,18,FDerbyshire, appeared fit and well at
OL,19,Fthe time, but doctors confirmed she had
OL,20,Fneuroblastoma, a childhood cancer that
OL,21,Fdevelops from immature nerve cells.
OL,23,APub: 27-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,362,360,200,160,0,100
