OL,3,GNEWSAFootball to the face revealed my
OL,4,Adaughter's cancer
OL,5,
OL,6,FNottingham University Hospitals NHS
OL,7,FTrust (NUH) said that, while the ball
OL,8,Finjury did not cause the cancer, the
OL,9,Flump on Harper's neck led to the scans
OL,10,Fand biopsies that resulted in the
OL,11,Fdiagnosis.
